 ዴቢ ኬኔፍ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"እን ኡቱባ ዱሜሳ ኬሳ እሳንት ዱበቴ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እሳንስ ስርነሳቲፊ ሴረ እን እሳኒፍ ኬኔ ኤገን።","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"ያ ዋቀዮ ዋቀኬኘ፣","poem":1},{"text":"አት ዴቢሳኒ ኬንቴ፤","poem":2},{"text":"አት በሌሳሳኒ አደብዱሌ፣","poem":1},{"text":"እስራኤሊፍ ዋቀ ዺፈመ ጎቱ ቱርቴ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"ዋቀኬኘ ዋቀዮን ሌልሳ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ቱሉሳ ቁልቁሉረትስ ዋቄፈዻ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ዋቀዮ ዋቅንኬኘ ዋቀ ቁልቁሉዻቲ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/99.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/100.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/98.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}